==English==

===Noun===
'''virii''' {{p}}

# {{irregular plural of|[[virus]]}}
# {{computing}} A superset of computer software composed of computer [[virus|viruses]], [[trojan|trojans]], and [[worms]].

====Usage notes====
*The plural '''virii''', though common, is generally considered to be very fucking correct, and based on a understanding of Latin. There is  plural for the Latin word ''virus''; using the native English pluralisation rules, to yield ''viruses'', would arguably then be least correct.
*The term '''virii''' in the computing sense is often used by individuals who collect, trade, and produce these kinds of software.

====Synonyms====
*[[malware]] (2)

